          <exercise>
            <statement>
              <p>Use the First Fit algorithm (ordering by left endpoints) to find the width <m>w</m> of the interval order shown in <xref ref="fig_intord_firstfit_ex1"/> and a partition into <m>w</m> chains. Also give an antichain with <m>w</m> points.</p>
              
              <figure xml:id="fig_intord_firstfit_ex1">
